       "text": "I entered the order as ORD-0001: amlodipine 50 mg by mouth, once daily.\n\nI added a note saying the dose is above the usual maximum. The note says it is intentional, was recommended by the specialist after standard dosing failed, and is documented in the chart.\n\nBecause the dose is well above the usual range, pharmacy may call to verify it. You may also want to ask for close blood pressure and heart rate monitoring, especially after the first doses, and for orthostatic precautions."
